  "notes": "{位置|いち}する means to be located or situated.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧)\n- Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{位置|いち}する (to be located at/in X)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {位置|いち}して⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: is located (current state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{位置|いち}する: to be located at/in ~\n- ～⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{北|きた}→北：00644_kita⟧/⟦{南|みなみ}→南：00652_minami⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{位置|いち}する: located to the north/south of ~\n- ⟦{中心|ちゅうしん}→中心：01467_chuushin⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{位置|いち}する: located in the center\n\nUSAGE:\n{位置|いち}する is more formal than ⟦ある→ある：00006_aru⟧. It's common in:\n- Geographic descriptions\n- Official documents\n- Academic writing\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{位置|いち}→位置：11554_ichi⟧: position, location (noun)\n- ⟦ある→ある：00006_aru⟧: to be (general existence)\n- ⟦{所在|しょざい}→所在：12749_shozai⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to be situated (formal)",
